# Never commit keys, settings, recordings or anything the app wrote locally.
# On Windows these live under %APPDATA%\Dikte and %LOCALAPPDATA%\Dikte; on
# Linux under ~/.config/dikte and ~/.local/share/dikte. Guard against any of
# them being copied into the checkout anyway.
config.json
*.key
*.pem
.env
.env.*